  designNotes: 'Wonder Guard (the user, 2026-10-17: ''would be better for holy''):
    Immaculate. Attacks and effects do nothing to it; only a status (Burn) hurts
    it, and with 1 Health any Burn is the end. Doomed and Destroy still take it.'
  artDescription: A translucent white sheet-ghost with a golden halo and two round
    eye holes, hovering serenely in a church aisle while arrows and bullets pass
    straight through it and clatter on the floor behind, a dove on its head, and
    in the corner a single lit match it eyes with real fear.
